Use Oidc\cOidcHandler.pkg
Use Oidc\OidcDefaultProvider.wo

Object oOidcDefaultHandler is a cOidcHandler
    Set phoOidcProvider to oOidcDefaultProvider
    
    Set phoLoginView to (GetLoginView(ghoWebApp))
    Set phoOidcProvider of (GetLoginView(ghoWebApp)) to oOidcDefaultProvider
    
    Set phoOidcConsentView to (phoOidcConsentView(ghoWebApp))
    Set phoOidcProvider of (phoOidcConsentView(ghoWebApp)) to oOidcDefaultProvider
    If ((phoOidcConsentView(ghoWebApp)) <> C_WebUnresolvedObject) Begin
        Send RegisterNavigateForwardPath ntNavigateBegin (phoOidcConsentView(ghoWebApp)) ghoWebApp ""
    End
End_Object
